  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《溪林路</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">——記念二林蔗農事件</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">呂莛鈺</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEge8Fwgnhghgk0PHXnjI4knkq7jJHPpQ3iDYo8Ak2XkkD0o5jGTmeX9DhVCLFC_-MtRLpWp_Jw3zxZzF8H-u2owI1Kv1RbLeGnmGhJjcRujQYq15pvCXbnfsiv5-cUTtqk2qPVDekmcifhYp_2lnySmRDYVWIzEVt3xHoqzNvM332Z1XSSSBXBSfJpOrVHM\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEge8Fwgnhghgk0PHXnjI4knkq7jJHPpQ3iDYo8Ak2XkkD0o5jGTmeX9DhVCLFC_-MtRLpWp_Jw3zxZzF8H-u2owI1Kv1RbLeGnmGhJjcRujQYq15pvCXbnfsiv5-cUTtqk2qPVDekmcifhYp_2lnySmRDYVWIzEVt3xHoqzNvM332Z1XSSSBXBSfJpOrVHM=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一節一節ê五分仔車</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Uì溪墘厝</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">　坐到溪州林糖會社</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">4</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">聽講hia有真濟甘蔗</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">天色bông-bông</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有人早起ê形影</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿公食頭路tī hia</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">為著規家伙仔食飯飽</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一節一節ê五分仔車</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Uì溪墘厝　駛到二林庄</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">聽講hia有真濟甘蔗</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">人生茫茫</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">作穡人ê拍拚</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">是糖廠王國tshia-iānn ê名聲</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">是siáng gōng-gōng　kā甘蔗種hōo會社磅？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">是siáng悾悾　種甘蔗hōo會社ê苦？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Kám有人疼？　Tse lóng是命</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">人生一tsuā　siáng beh認命？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">濁水溪北爿ê五分仔車</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">聽阿爸講古</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tuè阿公跤步</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Uì 溪州到二林<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">行--過ê路</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsiânn做歷史</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsiânn做「溪林路」</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\"><div>1 溪林路（Khe-lîm-lōo）：路名，彰化縣內，連接溪州鄉kah二林鎮ê縣道。</div><div>2 編註:發生tī日本時代1925年10月22 ê衝突事件，主要是因為製糖會社收買甘蔗價siàu siunn低，蔗農不滿，kah警察起衝突。&nbsp;</div><div>3 溪墘厝（Khe-kînn-tshù）：地名，彰化縣溪州鄉溪墘厝地區，khah早有設五分車站。</div><div>4 林糖會社：全名「林本源製糖株式會社」，日本時代tī彰化溪州鄉設ê糖廠，由板橋林本源家族協助出資。&nbsp;</div></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /